age will be captured in different light intensities and pose. These images are stored in the database. This is training. When the person faces the camera, his/her images will be verified with that of the trained images in the database. This is testing. The final step is the prediction, which tells us if it is a success ( when there is a match between the image captured and the images in the database) or a failure ( when there is no match between the image captured and the images in the database).","topics":[],"score":287218,"global_rank":28755,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5892},{"name":"zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","owner":"zaro0508","html_url":"https://github.com/zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"A set of Sceptre resolvers to help identify a stack","topics":[],"score":287205,"global_rank":28764,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5893},{"name":"renysaldivar/Charms","owner":"renysaldivar","html_url":"https://github.com/renysaldivar/Charms","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":287194,"global_rank":28772,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5894},{"name":"GreatWyrm/NightfallBot","owner":"GreatWyrm","html_url":"https://github.com/GreatWyrm/NightfallBot","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"A bot to run on the Nightfall Server","topics":[],"score":287170,"global_rank":28784,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5895},{"name":"vidhishanair/TwiBot","owner":"vidhishanair","html_url":"https://github.com/vidhishanair/TwiBot","stars":5,"forks":4,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A twitter based summation tool, classifier and visualiser on trending data.","topics":[],"score":287161,"global_rank":28788,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5896},{"name":"Sage-Bionetworks/sysbioDCCjsonschemas","owner":"Sag